{"schema_version":"axignal.connector-sdk-registry/v0.1","task_id":"AX-GE2E-P04-T01","programme_version":"1.4.0","status":"DRAFT_ENGINEERING_FOUNDATION","human_authorised_branch_start":true,"canonical_activation_authorised":false,"dependency_status":{"p03_task":"AX-GE2E-P03-T01","p03_engineering_head":"3b950b1b111a0eb6e3b9b330cc15887db8699f3c","p03_engineering_evidence_ready":true,"p03_canonical_activation_authorised":false,"p02_canonical_activation_authorised":false,"p01_dependency_satisfied":false,"stacked_base_branch":"agent/ax-ge2e-p03-security-identity-rights-v1.4","merge_to_main_allowed":false},"trust_principles":["A connector is an untrusted data-plane adapter and has zero canonical admission authority.","Technical reachability never proves legal authority, rights, quality, privacy safety or product suitability.","Every source requires a versioned source profile and independently reviewable rights snapshot.","Unknown, stale, ambiguous, conflicting or revoked source authority fails closed.","Raw payloads are transient by default and persistence requires an explicit right and data-class decision.","Source-native values, identifiers, taxonomies and temporal ambiguity are preserved rather than silently repaired.","Connector output is limited to candidate source objects, candidate evidence and diagnostics.","Models may propose parsing or mappings but cannot approve rights, quality, admission, revocation or recovery.","All network destinations, redirects, authentication methods and payload bounds are declared and enforced.","Retries are bounded, idempotent and subordinate to rate limits, budgets, circuit breakers and kill switches.","Outage, schema drift, quality regression and revocation change lifecycle state before new materialisation.","Deletion and revocation propagate through derived artifacts without erasing audit evidence.","A source reaches PRODUCT_ADMITTED only after separate security, rights and product approvals.","Every connector package must pass the s